comments.body:
I only found one other manual` Error(...) `construction, but might still be cleaner to have a factory here too, e.g. `BlockValidationState::ErrorState(reject_reason)`. Then this becomes:

```suggestion
    notifications.fatalError(message);
    return BlockValidationState::ErrorState(message.original);

```

